@baseUrl = http://localhost:5187
@token = COLE_SEU_TOKEN_LOCAL_SEM_COMMITAR
@reportId = SUBSTITUA_PELO_ID

### Solicitar (Employee)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromDate":"2026-09-01","toDate":"2026-09-30","scope":"Mine"}

### Listar pedidos próprios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Acompanhar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Download
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}/excel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Global (Auditor)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromDate":"2026-09-01","toDate":"2026-09-30","scope":"Global"}
